## Original Content
कोलकाता की पार्क स्ट्रीट पर फुटपाथ से लोगों को हटाने के अभियान के दौरान मंत्री अग्निमित्रा पॉल विवादों में घिर गईं. एक वीडियो में उन्हें एक महिला से बहस करते हुए देखा गया, जो अपने बच्चे के लिए दूध गर्म कर रही थी. इस घटना की आलोचना हुई और बाद में पॉल ने कहा कि वह इस स्थिति को अलग तरह से संभाल सकती थीं.

## Summary
Minister Agnimitra Paul faced criticism after a video showed her arguing with a woman who was heating milk for her child during a footpath clearance operation in Kolkata. The incident sparked political debate, and Paul later admitted she could have handled the situation more sensitively.

## Key Points
- Minister Agnimitra Paul was involved in a controversy during a drive to remove people from footpaths in Kolkata's Park Street.
- A video of her arguing with a woman heating milk for her child led to public backlash.
- Paul acknowledged that she could have managed the situation with greater empathy.
- The incident has become a focal point for political discussions in Bengal.


